<title>USA: Iomega declines comment on stock activity.</title>
<headline>Iomega declines comment on stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Wednesday that it asked Iomega Corp to issue a public statement to explain the recent jump in its stock price but said the company declined to issue such a statement.</p>
<p>The stock was up 1-3/4 at 21 in early afternoon trading Wednesday.  Tuesday it rose 1/2 to 19-1/4.</p>
<p>&quot;The company stated that its policy is not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors,&quot; the NYSE said.</p>
